    {
      "type": "text",
      "props": {
        "html": "Hello [[FIRSTNAME OR \"Friend\"]],<br><br>The galleries cover a lot of ground in one visit. The rest of Theodore Roosevelt's life is online, told in six chapters, from a Manhattan childhood to an unmapped river in the Amazon.",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "columns",
      "props": {
        "cols": [
          {
            "src": "proposals/img/pv-tr-badlands.jpg",
            "alt": "Theodore Roosevelt in buckskin standing guard with his rifle",
            "heading": "The Badlands",
            "text": "He came to Dakota to hunt a bison and stayed to run cattle on the Little Missouri. Read how the Badlands gave him a new life.",
            "label": "Read the Chapter",
            "href": "https://www.trlibrary.com/tr/badlands"
          },
          {
            "src": "proposals/img/pv-tr-conservation.jpg",
            "alt": "Yosemite Valley with El Capitan and Half Dome",
            "heading": "Conservation",
            "text": "Parks, forests, monuments and bird reserves: roughly 230 million acres protected, and how he did it.",
            "label": "Explore",
            "href": "https://www.trlibrary.com/tr/presidency/conservation"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "button",
