        "align": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "props": {
        "html": "Ted Roosevelt V hosts conversations with people who step into the arena to build up the country and protect the planet. The <i>Live from the TRPL</i> series is recorded at the Library, beginning with presidential historian Doris Kearns Goodwin. Good Citizen was a 2024 Webby Award Honoree.",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
